WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.617
These are supplied fictional comparison figures.

00:00:02.617 --> 00:00:06.105
The manual task including review takes eight minutes.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:11.338
Assisted drafting takes five minutes, then review and correction take four more.

00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:14.391
The comparable assisted task takes nine minutes.

00:00:14.391 --> 00:00:17.444
First-draft speed alone hides the additional work.

00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:22.677
Record a baseline using the same task and boundary, including review effort.

00:00:22.677 --> 00:00:27.910
In your own project, say not yet measured when no baseline exists.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:39.684
Define a quality measure, such as source accuracy and corrections required, and a people-experience measure, such as whether the participant can identify the review and question route.

00:00:39.684 --> 00:00:42.301
State how you will observe each.

00:00:42.301 --> 00:00:46.226
A time saving cannot decide expansion on its own.

00:00:46.226 --> 00:00:52.767
Quality, usable support, human control, risk and actual permission also inform the accountable owner’s decision.
